---

<Base title="About · Pravine Mani · Toronto AI, SEO & Marketing Automation Consultant" description="Toronto solo operator. AI workflows. Programmatic SEO + GEO. Marketing automation. Built like an operator. McMaster Comp Eng '25." jsonLd={jsonLd}>


<section class="page-hero about-hero">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><span class="gr">$</span> cat ~/about.md <span class="you">→ pravine mani · short version</span></div>
  <div class="about-hero-grid">
    <div class="about-hero-text">
      <h1>Solo operator. AI · SEO · marketing automation.<br><span class="accent">Toronto, Canada.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Short version: I help founders, agency owners, and ops leads ship AI, SEO, and marketing automation that keeps working without you. Productized engagements. Fixed scope. No retainers. Adjacent: I build AIOpsForge, a community for solo AI builders.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-portrait">
      <figure class="portrait-frame">
        <div class="portrait-chrome">
          <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="tag">~/identity</span>
          <span class="live">● LIVE</span>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/about-photo.jpg"
          alt="Pravine Manivannan. Toronto-based AI, SEO, and marketing automation consultant"
          width="400"
          height="400"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="portrait-img"
        />
        <figcaption class="portrait-meta">
          <span>PRAVINE MANIVANNAN</span>
          <span class="gr">TORONTO · 2025-PRESENT</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="bio-grid">

    <div class="bio-main">
      <h2>The long version.</h2>
      <p>I started shipping web apps in 2022. Threads clones. Price-scrapers. Fine-dining landing pages. The usual indie portfolio. I picked up Next.js, TypeScript, and Supabase the way most builders did during the post-ChatGPT scramble: build something every weekend until the patterns stick.</p>
      <p><strong>The pivot point was Claude Code dropping in 2024.</strong> "Automate this in a weekend" suddenly meant it. The gap between "I have an idea" and "this is running in production" collapsed from weeks to days. I went deep on sub-agents, MCP, hooks, and headless mode. Started getting paid to do for other founders what I was already doing for myself.</p>
      <p>Now I do two things. <strong>Consulting across AI, SEO, and marketing automation</strong> for founders, agency owners, and ops leads who need workflows shipped fast. <a href="/services/">Four productized engagement shapes</a>: Scoping Call, Audit, Sprint, Custom. Fixed scope. Fixed price. And <strong>AIOpsForge</strong>, a community teaching other operators to ship the same way. Build guides. Prompts. Skills. Mentoring.</p>
      <p>I'm not trying to scale into an agency. The whole point is that one operator with the right stack can deliver what teams of 3-5 used to. Solo means I keep ownership of the work, charge fixed prices, and ship without committee.</p>

      <h2>How I work.</h2>
      <p><strong>Async-first.</strong> Slack or email plus recorded Looms. Live calls only when they need to be live: kickoff, milestone demo, post-launch retro. Async wins on quality and respects both calendars.</p>
      <p><strong>Written-first.</strong> Every engagement starts with a written spec, sent before signing. Every milestone ends with a Loom + written summary. I'd rather over-document than re-explain.</p>
      <p><strong>Opinionated stack.</strong> Claude Code + Vercel + a few well-chosen SaaS. <a href="/stack/">Full stack here.</a> If you're committed to a different one and it makes sense for what you need built, I'll work in it. No preference? I'll use mine.</p>
      <p><strong>Code-first automation.</strong> No n8n. No Make.com. No Zapier. Workflows are Vercel serverless functions + cron. Versioned in git. $0 platform fee. Debuggable when something breaks at 3am.</p>

      <h2>What I'm not.</h2>
      <p>Not a designer. Not a data scientist. Not building chatbots for customer service. Not in the AGI or AI-safety space. Not available for full-time positions. Solo by choice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bio-side">
      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">QUICK FACTS</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">BASED</span><span class="v">Toronto, Canada</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">SHIPPING</span><span class="v">Since 2022</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">SOLO</span><span class="v"><span class="acc">By choice</span></span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">STATUS</span><span class="v"><span class="acc">Open Q3</span> · 2 slots</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">STACK</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DEV</span><span class="v">Claude Code, Vercel</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">AI</span><span class="v">Claude 4.7, MCP</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DATA</span><span class="v">Vercel KV, Supabase</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">DEPLOY</span><span class="v">Vercel cron + serverless</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">ANALYTICS</span><span class="v">Plausible</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="fact-card">
        <div class="label">OUTSIDE WORK</div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">CITY</span><span class="v">Toronto · year-round</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">RUNNING</span><span class="v">5k thrice / week</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">READING</span><span class="v">~2 books / month</span></div>
        <div class="item"><span class="k">NEVER</span><span class="v">Crypto trading (again)</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="now-block" id="now">
    <div class="now-block-head">
      <div class="label">RIGHT NOW · WEEK OF MAY 18</div>
      <h2>What I'm shipping this week.</h2>
      <p>A <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/now</a> page in the Sivers spirit. What I'm actually working on. Updated weekly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="now-grid">
      <div class="now-panel">
        <div class="now-panel-head"><span class="lab">CURRENT FOCUS</span><span class="meta">ALL-IN</span></div>
        <h3>Building AIOpsForge into a community for solo AI builders.</h3>
        <p>Live on Whop. Weekly build guides. AI coach trained on the curriculum. Gated workspace across 14 areas.</p>
        <p>Adjacent: <strong>consulting across AI, SEO, and marketing automation</strong>. Taking new engagements. See <a href="/services/">/services</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="now-panel">
        <div class="now-panel-head"><span class="lab">SHIPPED RECENTLY</span><span class="meta">Q2 2026</span></div>
        <div class="week-rail">
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">CISNET</span><span class="what">Next.js 16 migration + 200+ pSEO pages + admin portal · shipped Q4 2025</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">AOF</span><span class="what">14-area community workspace + AI coach on Whop · live</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item done"><span class="day">SKILLS</span><span class="what">personalClaudeSkills open-sourced on GitHub · 3 skills installable</span><span class="check">✓</span></div>
          <div class="item now"><span class="day">SITE</span><span class="what">pravinemani.com Tier-A repositioning · ICP-sharpened for SaaS founders + agencies</span><span class="check">▸</span></div>
          <div class="item"><span class="day">NEXT</span><span class="what">First SaaS-founder Sprint at founding rate · outreach in progress</span><span class="check">○</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2026</span><span class="what"><strong>AIOpsForge launched.</strong> Community for solo AI builders on Whop. Active consulting across AI, SEO, marketing automation.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2025</span><span class="what">Pivoted fully to AI / SEO / marketing automation consulting. <strong>CISNET marketing site + SEO infrastructure.</strong> 200+ pages on Next.js 16 + Vercel.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2024</span><span class="what">Claude Code released. Went deep: sub-agents, MCP, hooks, headless mode. First commercial AI workflows for indie founders.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2023</span><span class="what">Solo dev portfolio years. Threads clone. PriceScraper. Prompty. CarHub. Gericht. One a weekend to learn patterns.</span></div>
    <div class="yr"><span class="year">2022</span><span class="what">Started shipping web apps in earnest. First Next.js + TypeScript + Supabase project. The "I can actually build this" year.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-cta reveal" style="text-align: center;">
    <p style="margin: 0;">More on what I build: <a href="/services/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">/services</a> · or the <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">contact page →</a></p>
  </div>

</section>


</Base>
<style is:global>
.bio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
.bio-main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
.bio-main h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-top: 16px; }
.bio-main h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.bio-main p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 680px; }
.bio-main p strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.bio-main p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }
.bio-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.fact-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 22px 24px; position: relative; }
.fact-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--card-accent, var(--green)); opacity: 0.8; }
.fact-card .label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.fact-card .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; }
.fact-card .item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.fact-card .item .k { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fact-card .item .v { color: var(--text-primary); }
.fact-card .item .v .acc { color: var(--green); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(1) { --card-accent: var(--green); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(2) { --card-accent: var(--red); }
.fact-card:nth-of-type(3) { --card-accent: #a855f7; }
.timeline { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 24px 28px; margin-top: 24px; }
.timeline .yr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); align-items: baseline; }
.timeline .yr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.timeline .yr .year { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--green); font-weight: 500; }
.timeline .yr .what { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
.timeline .yr .what strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
@media (max-width: 980px) { .bio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* About bio H2 (was h3 before) */
.bio-main h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.2; }
.bio-main h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

/* About hero. 2-col on desktop, photo on the right */
.about-hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
}
.about-hero-text h1 { margin-bottom: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 24px); }
.about-hero-text .lead { max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: 0; }
@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .about-hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  .about-hero-text { order: 1; }
  .about-portrait { order: 2; }
}

/* About portrait */
.about-portrait { margin-top: 0; max-width: 440px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; }
.portrait-frame { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.portrait-frame::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--bg-tertiary);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--border); display: inline-block; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .tag { margin-left: 6px; flex: 1; }
.portrait-frame .portrait-chrome .live { color: var(--green); }
.portrait-img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: contrast(1.02) saturate(0.95);
  background: var(--bg-tertiary);
}
.portrait-meta {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.portrait-meta .gr { color: var(--green); font-size: 9px; }

/* About bottom CTA */
.about-cta { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, var(--bg-tertiary) 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border-green); padding: 44px 36px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 32px; }
.about-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center top, rgba(0,255,65,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
.about-cta > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.about-cta h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.about-cta h2 .accent { color: var(--green); }
.about-cta p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 580px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

/* "Right now" merged section (was /now/ page) */
.now-block { margin-top: 36px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px); position: relative; scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
.now-block::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
.now-block-head { margin-bottom: 22px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.now-block-head .label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.now-block-head h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(22px, 1.9vw, 30px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.018em; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.now-block-head p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 64ch; }
.now-block-head p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }

.now-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 18px; }
@media (max-width: 880px) { .now-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.now-panel { background: var(--bg-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.now-panel-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.now-panel-head .lab { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; }
.now-panel-head .meta { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.now-panel h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25; }
.now-panel p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
.now-panel p strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.now-panel p a { color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green); }

.week-rail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.week-rail .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr auto; gap: 14px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13.5px; }
.week-rail .item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.week-rail .item .day { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.week-rail .item.done .day { color: var(--green); }
.week-rail .item.now .day { color: #ffd84a; }
.week-rail .item .what { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.45; }
.week-rail .item.done .what { color: var(--text-primary); }
.week-rail .item.now .what { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
.week-rail .item .what strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
.week-rail .item .check { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); }
.week-rail .item.done .check { color: var(--green); }
.week-rail .item.now .check { color: #ffd84a; }
</style>
